"Behind the fall over the Stillpool is a dry rock shelf, hidden by the water, big enough to camp on."
"A bronze chest sits wedged at the back of the shelf behind the Stillpool's fall."
"The bronze chest behind the fall holds a stout spear of black wood and 15 knowledge points."
"Silverfin, a fat river fish, shoal in the Stillpool and can be caught by hand in the shallows."
